  "_doc": "The Mixamo humanoid (bare bone names, no mixamorig: prefix): every bone at the full finger level with its parent, parents before children. A finger bone names its finger third. A finger level keeps the bones whose finger is in fingerLevels[level] (Mixamo's skeleton options; at one and two the Index chain is a mitten down the middle of the four fingers; at three the Index chain is the index finger and the Middle chain a mitten down the middle of the other three). Read by src/model/skeletons.ts, src/engine/mixamo.ts and blender/autorig/mixamo.py. `anatomy`: where each long finger's joints sit along the hand (Mixamo's proportions): the knuckle's reach along the hand as a fraction of the tip's, then the two middle joints as fractions of knuckle -> tip; the finger trace (blender/autorig/fingers.py) and the marker board (src/engine/markers.ts) both lay fingers by it.",
